348-  packages/<pkg>/src/index.ts --target node --format esm --outfile packages/<pkg>/dist/index.js`
349-  (a multi-entry package repeats it per entry, e.g. `packages/mpd-ext-plugin/src/sdk.ts` →
350-  `packages/mpd-ext-plugin/dist/sdk.js`). This is the CANONICAL form: `bun build` writes the entry
